Is RWordPress the package of choice for createing blog entries from R notebook data analysis and apps hosted on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>?

What is the recommended workflow for publishing a blog  entry (on Wordpress or other blogging sites),  from R notebook analysis and  shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> apps?

